{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "5 小时窗口 · 中号(2026-09-24):小号的完整版。左 = 这个窗口已用多少(按 API 标价);右 = 输出 token 与回复条数;条 = 时间走了多少(不是额度,官方剩余额度拿不到);底 = 开始 → 重置、还剩多久、按目前速度到重置约多少。\n「还剩多久」在取数流里按此刻算(wEnd − now),不是服务端响应那一刻。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "5 小时窗口",
        "empty": "等待首次同步",
        "lang": "zh",
        "used": "已用 · 按 API 标价",
        "idle": "不在窗口中",
        "idleSub": "下一次对话开始计时",
        "out": "输出",
        "replies": "回复",
        "left": " · 还剩 ",
        "h": " 小时 ",
        "m": " 分",
        "proj": "按目前的速度，到 ",
        "projB": " 约 "
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "5-hour window",
        "empty": "Not synced yet",
        "lang": "en",
        "used": "Used · API list prices",
        "idle": "No active window",
        "idleSub": "Starts with your next message",
        "out": "Output",
        "replies": "Replies",
        "left": " · ",
        "h": "h ",
        "m": "m left",
        "proj": "On pace for ",
        "projB": " by "
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90",
        "_note": "5 小时窗口 · 中号(2026-09-24):小号的完整版。左 = 这个窗口已用多少(按 API 标价);右 = 输出 token 与回复条数;条 = 时间走了多少(不是额度,官方剩余额度拿不到);底 = 开始 → 重置、还剩多久、按目前速度到重置约多少。"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色身份点:本包统一用 Claude 暖橙两档。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-94pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${winOn},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "big",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "36pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}*0.5",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${winUsd},--)]",
            "fontSize": "28pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "70pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}*0.5",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.used}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "{parent.w}*0.56",
            "y": "40pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}*0.2",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.out}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "{parent.w}*0.56",
            "y": "53pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}*0.2",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${winOutNum},--)]${winOutUnit}",
            "fontSize": "16pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "{parent.w}*0.78",
            "y": "40pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}*0.22-14pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.replies}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "{parent.w}*0.78",
            "y": "53pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}*0.22-14pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${winN},--)]",
            "fontSize": "16pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(${winOn},1),0,1),1),if::(eq::(${live},1),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "40pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.idle}",
            "fontSize": "17pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "64pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.idleSub}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(${winOn},1),0,1),1),if::(eq::(${live},1),0,1),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "36pt+8.4pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}*0.5",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "28pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "70pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}*0.5",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.used}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "{parent.w}*0.56",
            "y": "40pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}*0.2",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.out}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "{parent.w}*0.56",
            "y": "53pt+4.8pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}*0.2",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "16pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "{parent.w}*0.78",
            "y": "40pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}*0.22-14pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.replies}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "{parent.w}*0.78",
            "y": "53pt+4.8pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}*0.22-14pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "16pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}-50pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
        "h": "6pt",
        "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "3pt",
          "leftB": "3pt",
          "rightT": "3pt",
          "rightB": "3pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(gt::(${winPct},0),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-50pt",
            "w": "({parent.w}-28pt)*${winPct}/100",
            "h": "6pt",
            "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "3pt",
              "leftB": "3pt",
              "rightT": "3pt",
              "rightB": "3pt"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${winOn},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-37pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${winStartTxt} → ${winReset}${@i18n.left}$[if::(gt::(${winLeftH},0),${winLeftH}${@i18n.h},)]${winLeftM}${@i18n.m}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(if::(eq::(${winOn},1),1,0),1),if::(eq::(connect::(k,${winProj}),k),0,1),0),1),if::(eq::(${@i18n.lang},en),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-22pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.proj}${winProj}${@i18n.projB}${winReset}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(if::(eq::(${winOn},1),1,0),1),if::(eq::(connect::(k,${winProj}),k),0,1),0),1),if::(eq::(${@i18n.lang},en),0,1),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-22pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.proj}${winReset}${@i18n.projB}${winProj}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "时效锚:右上角、与卡名同一基线、9pt、右对齐(卡片设计系统 §3)。",
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},${@i18n.empty})]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      }
    ]
  }
}